<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="e97a3583">Benefits Reports should then be produced from the data within the tracker. It may be that different benefit reports are
produced for different stakeholders as some may only be interested in particular benefits. Any measures that show
significant variation from previous period or from expected value should be highlighted within the report and supporting
explanatory comments should be provided when known. Prior to publication, reports should be subject to a detailed quality
review to ensure that all information is accurate and current.</attribute>
